==German==
{{was fwotd|de|2019|May|10}}

===Etymology===
{{af|de|Sonntag|-s-|Schrift|t1=Sunday|t3=writing}}

The sense “tidy handwriting” was probably formed following {{m|de|Sonntagskleidung|t=Sunday best}}, from the aspect of tidiness.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈzɔntaksˌʃʁɪft/}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Sonn|tags|schrift}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# {{lb|de|colloquial}} [[diligent]]ly [[tidy]] [[handwriting]] {{q|often used in an [[ironic]] fashion}}
#: {{usex|de|Wie, du kannst das nicht lesen? Ich hab das doch in meiner schönsten '''Sonntagsschrift''' geschrieben.|Why, you can't read that? But I have written it in my '''prettiest handwriting'''.}}
